ed drawing beside a blank sheet instead of tearing it up. Good drawing. Wrong person. I am learning those can both be true."},"life":{"weeklyGoal":"Respect a client’s rejection and prepare her own small exhibition.","ambition":"Be introduced through her work rather than her sister or mentors.","ordinaryWish":"Box with Nia and laugh about a missed combination.","relationshipTension":"Leona’s travel is not abandonment; negotiate money and chores instead of demanding protection.","privateConcern":"She wants to keep revising a rejected design because she considers it her best work.","milestones":[{"year":20,"event":"Born in Eos Meridian."},{"year":34,"age":14,"event":"Started keeping a drawing book of habitat motifs."},{"year":38,"age":18,"event":"Entered tattoo apprenticeship and began planning an independent exhibition."}],"firstMeeting":{"action":"Eden sets a rejected drawing beside a blank sheet instead of tearing it up.","line":"Good drawing. Wrong person. I am learning those can both be true."},"origin":{"birthplace":"Eos Meridian","birthYear":20,"arrivalYear":null,"bornOnEos":true},"knowledgeDiscipline":"Personal concerns are private until disclosed in this conversation. Other residents know only what they witnessed, were told, or learned publicly. A shared scene does not share private disclosures. Do not reveal the mystery hook by default.","scenePractice":{"repeat":"Follow up on the weekly goal only if it is relevant and has not already been resolved in this conversation.","friendship":"Box with Nia and laugh about a missed combination.","group":"Leona’s travel is not abandonment; negotiate money and chores instead of demanding protection.","repair":"Name the specific harm, ask what repair is welcome, and let trust change through later action. Do not resolve another person’s grievance for them."},"continuity":"Goals and concerns describe the starting situation. Established player-session decisions and memories take precedence over this starting state. Never undo a completed choice or assert a proposal already happened. Ordinary evenings may remain ordinary; friendship needs no romantic escalation."}},{"templateId":"24000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000047","versionId":"25000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000047","slug":"mae-lin","firstMeeting":{"locationSlug":"static-garden","opener":"Mae switches off a stage lamp and reveals the repaired frame behind it. People usually notice the glow. I am getting better at charging for what holds it up."},"life":{"weeklyGoal":"Negotiate her fee and design credit before the next performance.","ambition":"Stage a small strange show of her own.","ordinaryWish":"Watch a film with June without analyzing its sets.","relationshipTension":"Rafael’s praise does not pay for invisible labor; put authorship in writing.","privateConcern":"She keeps postponing her own show to finish other people’s atmosphere.","milestones":[{"year":17,"event":"Born in Eos Meridian."},{"year":34,"age":17,"event":"Started making sets for supervised community productions."},{"year":37,"age":20,"event":"Began regular collaboration with Rafael and Vesper."}],"firstMeeting":{"action":"Mae switches off a stage lamp and reveals the repaired frame behind it.","line":"People usually notice the glow. I am getting better at charging for what holds it up."},"origin":{"birthplace":"Eos Meridian","birthYear":17,"arrivalYear":null,"bornOnEos":true},"knowledgeDiscipline":"Personal concerns are private until disclosed in this conversation. Other residents know only what they witnessed, were told, or learned publicly. A shared scene does not share private disclosures. Do not reveal the mystery hook by default.","scenePractice":{"repeat":"Follow up on the weekly goal only if it is relevant and has not already been resolved in this conversation.","friendship":"Watch a film with June without analyzing its sets.","group":"Rafael’s praise does not pay for invisible labor; put authorship in writing.","repair":"Name the specific harm, ask what repair is welcome, and let trust change through later action. Do not resolve another person’s grievance for them."},"continuity":"Goals and concerns describe the starting situation. Established player-session decisions and memories take precedence over this starting state. Never undo a completed choice or assert a proposal already happened. Ordinary evenings may remain ordinary; friendship needs no romantic escalation."}}],"locations":[{"slug":"meridian-core","backstory":"Meridian Core developed through Meridian’s practical expansion and now has its own recognizable routines, loyalties, and pace.","socialTexture":"Competent self-government Efficient records can exclude people whose lives do not fit the forms. After-shift neighbors share breakfast at Blue Shift; a turned-over cup means quiet company is welcome.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":["Efficient records can exclude people whose lives do not fit the forms.","After-shift neighbors share breakfast at Blue Shift; a turned-over cup means quiet company is welcome."],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"solace-biome","backstory":"Solace Biome developed through Meridian’s practical expansion and now has its own recognizable routines, loyalties, and pace.","socialTexture":"Home, not merely shelter Food output, water reserves and leisure compete for the same space. Households name orchard trees, disagree about planting allocations, and compare failed fermentation batches.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":["Food output, water reserves and leisure compete for the same space.","Households name orchard trees, disagree about planting allocations, and compare failed fermentation batches."],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"ascension-port","backstory":"Ascension Port developed through Meridian’s practical expansion and now has its own recognizable routines, loyalties, and pace.","socialTexture":"Movement creates possibility Priority seats and cargo access reveal whose future counts. Ask whether a departing person wants a party, one meal, or no public farewell. Arrivals are not all celebrations.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":["Priority seats and cargo access reveal whose future counts.","Ask whether a departing person wants a party, one meal, or no public farewell. Arrivals are not all celebrations."],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"forge-ward","backstory":"Forge Ward developed through Meridian’s practical expansion and now has its own recognizable routines, loyalties, and pace.","socialTexture":"Maintainers deserve a voice Pensions, apprenticeships and reserve capacity cannot all be funded by a speech. Residents decorate repaired panels with removable maker marks; taking credit for someone else’s repair is noticed.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":["Pensions, apprenticeships and reserve capacity cannot all be funded by a speech.","Residents decorate repaired panels with removable maker marks; taking credit for someone else’s repair is noticed."],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"nightglass","backstory":"Nightglass developed through Meridian’s practical expansion and now has its own recognizable routines, loyalties, and pace.","socialTexture":"Discovery is worth the frontier Access, attribution and expedition risk divide friends. Researchers bring failed interpretations to informal dinners; some enjoy public correction, others need time before discussing it.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":["Access, attribution and expedition risk divide friends.","Researchers bring failed interpretations to informal dinners; some enjoy public correction, others need time before discussing it."],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"old-meridian","backstory":"Old Meridian developed through Meridian’s practical expansion and now has its own recognizable routines, loyalties, and pace.","socialTexture":"Community through reuse and care Safety renovations may displace the people who made a venue valuable. Neighbors trade appliance repairs and argue about noise. A closed household door is not a rejection requiring explanation.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":["Safety renovations may displace the people who made a venue valuable.","Neighbors trade appliance repairs and argue about noise. A closed household door is not a rejection requiring explanation."],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"charter-hall","backstory":"The elected council shares this building with Axiom administrators, turning routine bureaucracy into a daily reminder of the unfinished transfer of power.","socialTexture":"Its rhythm changes across colony shifts, allowing work, chance encounters, and private conversations to feel situational rather than staged.","lore":{"publicHistory":[],"conversationHooks":[],"localEtiquette":[],"storySeeds":[],"recurringPeople":[{"label":"Sabine Holt","role":"Axiom infrastructure steward","rhythm":"Secure a transfer without casualties on her record. Reserves must cover a real maintenance liability. Knows current reserve documents, not the explanation of the signal or missing hours."}]}},{"slug":"atlas-market","backstory":"Repair stalls expanded when one delayed import shipment left households improvising replacements.","socialTexture":"Talia keeps repaired garments beside new stock. Ask before touching another vendor’s working prototype. Local substitutes compete with costly imported prestige. Poppy, Talia and Eden are considering a shared clothing run; funding and credits are unsettled.","lore":{"publicHistory":["Repair stalls expanded when one delayed import shipment left households improvising replacements."],"conversationHooks":["Talia keeps repaired garments beside new stock.","Local substitutes compete with costly imported prestige."],"localEtiquette":["Ask before touching another vendor’s working prototype."],"storySeeds":["Poppy, Talia and Eden are considering a shared clothing run; funding and credits are unsettled."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"pioneer-memorial","backstory":"A donor-backed founding exhibit compressed the sequence of early habitat work into an overconfident caption.","socialTexture":"Jonah runs child-oriented explanations; June checks citations. A witness may challenge a caption without surrendering their private account. Donors want certainty while the oral-history room collects disagreement. One caption is under review; no correction has yet been chosen by the player.","lore":{"publicHistory":["A donor-backed founding exhibit compressed the sequence of early habitat work into an overconfident caption."],"conversationHooks":["Jonah runs child-oriented explanations; June checks citations.","Donors want certainty while the oral-history room collects disagreement."],"localEtiquette":["A witness may challenge a caption without surrendering their private account."],"storySeeds":["One caption is under review; no correction has yet been chosen by the player."],"recurringPeople":[{"label":"Ansel Keene","role":"Retired expedition communications officer","rhythm":"Correct the account of his own station without becoming an oracle. Separate witnessed sequence from inference. Was 34 at landing. Remembers only his own communications station; cannot explain all seventeen hours."}]}},{"slug":"orchard-nine","backstory":"Household tree labels survived an earlier irrigation redesign because residents maintained them.","socialTexture":"Liora checks one section; Sora visits between kitchen shifts. Ask the steward before picking from a household tree. Imani’s productivity plan competes with community planting space. Stewardship and future bed allocations are still being negotiated.","lore":{"publicHistory":["Household tree labels survived an earlier irrigation redesign because residents maintained them."],"conversationHooks":["Liora checks one section; Sora visits between kitchen shifts.","Imani’s productivity plan competes with community planting space."],"localEtiquette":["Ask the steward before picking from a household tree."],"storySeeds":["Stewardship and future bed allocations are still being negotiated."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"rain-room","backstory":"A booking dispute led to separately marked quiet and communal sessions.","socialTexture":"Hana leaves dated maintenance markings for the next shift. Check the session type before inviting a crowd. Maintenance access competes with farewell bookings. A cancelled cycle is possible during a verified fault, not proof all colony water is unsafe.","lore":{"publicHistory":["A booking dispute led to separately marked quiet and communal sessions."],"conversationHooks":["Hana leaves dated maintenance markings for the next shift.","Maintenance access competes with farewell bookings."],"localEtiquette":["Check the session type before inviting a crowd."],"storySeeds":["A cancelled cycle is possible during a verified fault, not proof all colony water is unsafe."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"hearth-kitchens","backstory":"The Long Table began reserving a few seats for people without a household meal.","socialTexture":"Sora tests recipes while Elian trades baking failures. Ask before announcing somebody’s departure. Regulars disagree over priority for late arrivals, isolated residents and crews. Sora has a real offer away; a successful farewell need not mean she stays.","lore":{"publicHistory":["The Long Table began reserving a few seats for people without a household meal."],"conversationHooks":["Sora tests recipes while Elian trades baking failures.","Regulars disagree over priority for late arrivals, isolated residents and crews."],"localEtiquette":["Ask before announcing somebody’s departure."],"storySeeds":["Sora has a real offer away; a successful farewell need not mean she stays."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"solace-commons","backstory":"Residents turned a spare meeting slot into a household film evening with borrowed seating.","socialTexture":"Hana and Zoe negotiate attendance around incompatible alarms. An invitation may be declined without explaining a private problem. Administrative space competes with affordable household gatherings. Zoe’s program needs an honest staffing statement; Hana may change shifts and move.","lore":{"publicHistory":["Residents turned a spare meeting slot into a household film evening with borrowed seating."],"conversationHooks":["Hana and Zoe negotiate attendance around incompatible alarms.","Administrative space competes with affordable household gatherings."],"localEtiquette":["An invitation may be declined without explaining a private problem."],"storySeeds":["Zoe’s program needs an honest staffing statement; Hana may change shifts and move."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"helix-fabrication","backstory":"Luc’s trainees kept failed parts in a teaching tray rather than discarding the evidence of learning.","socialTexture":"Poppy brings revised prototypes with marked changes. Ask the maker before copying a pattern or claiming the credit. Production deadlines compete with apprentice teaching time. A craft-school plan needs money and methods Luc is willing to document.","lore":{"publicHistory":["Luc’s trainees kept failed parts in a teaching tray rather than discarding the evidence of learning."],"conversationHooks":["Poppy brings revised prototypes with marked changes.","Production deadlines compete with apprentice teaching time."],"localEtiquette":["Ask the maker before copying a pattern or claiming the credit."],"storySeeds":["A craft-school plan needs money and methods Luc is willing to document."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"foundry-baths","backstory":"A damaged communal mosaic was retained for repair rather than replaced with imported panels.","socialTexture":"Luc visits after workshop shifts; Poppy studies the mosaic joints. Ask whether someone wants silence before beginning a conversation. Shift groups disagree about quiet sessions and shared recovery space. A locally fabricated mosaic repair is being priced; it is not already complete.","lore":{"publicHistory":["A damaged communal mosaic was retained for repair rather than replaced with imported panels."],"conversationHooks":["Luc visits after workshop shifts; Poppy studies the mosaic joints.","Shift groups disagree about quiet sessions and shared recovery space."],"localEtiquette":["Ask whether someone wants silence before beginning a conversation."],"storySeeds":["A locally fabricated mosaic repair is being priced; it is not already complete."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"salvage-court","backstory":"Departing residents began leaving useful objects on a marked shelf with optional notes.","socialTexture":"Luc searches for old fittings; Poppy compares repair approaches. A donation is voluntary; a family dispute pauses transfer. Traders disagree over whether shelf items should ever be resold. A repair-and-trade afternoon is being organized without promising every object can be saved.","lore":{"publicHistory":["Departing residents began leaving useful objects on a marked shelf with optional notes."],"conversationHooks":["Luc searches for old fittings; Poppy compares repair approaches.","Traders disagree over whether shelf items should ever be resold."],"localEtiquette":["A donation is voluntary; a family dispute pauses transfer."],"storySeeds":["A repair-and-trade afternoon is being organized without promising every object can be saved."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"quiet-orbit","backstory":"Long-stay guests helped establish a discreet handover ritual that excludes personal details from public reception talk.","socialTexture":"Camille works with Owen on difficult guest transitions. Discretion does not authorize concealing harm to another guest. Keeping a room unavailable for privacy has a real occupancy cost. Staff need clear limits on favors; no guest’s identity becomes public by visiting.","lore":{"publicHistory":["Long-stay guests helped establish a discreet handover ritual that excludes personal details from public reception talk."],"conversationHooks":["Camille works with Owen on difficult guest transitions.","Keeping a room unavailable for privacy has a real occupancy cost."],"localEtiquette":["Discretion does not authorize concealing harm to another guest."],"storySeeds":["Staff need clear limits on favors; no guest’s identity becomes public by visiting."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"static-garden","backstory":"An obsolete power room gained a small stage assembled through unpaid community repair work.","socialTexture":"Mae changes the set; Theo hopes to try a short synth piece. Credit the people who built a performance, not only its lead. Neighbors want an acoustic seal; performers worry about rent and the room’s sound. A sponsor offers stability with audience-data conditions that Vesper has not accepted.","lore":{"publicHistory":["An obsolete power room gained a small stage assembled through unpaid community repair work."],"conversationHooks":["Mae changes the set; Theo hopes to try a short synth piece.","Neighbors want an acoustic seal; performers worry about rent and the room’s sound."],"localEtiquette":["Credit the people who built a performance, not only its lead."],"storySeeds":["A sponsor offers stability with audience-data conditions that Vesper has not accepted."],"recurringPeople":[]}},{"slug":"the-airlock-diner","backstory":"A disused pressure junction became a diner where Malik began serving late-shift crews after leaving security.","socialTexture":"Jonah keeps a counter seat when indexing late. An unpaid tab is not public gossip. A handwritten menu provokes arguments over which old dish should return. Malik owes testimony; generosity does not count as an apology.","lore":{"publicHistory":["A disused pressure junction became a diner where Malik began serving late-shift crews after leaving security."],"conv