omantic","probability":0.7,"durationMinutes":90,"recurrence":{"weekday":6,"startMinute":900},"summary":"Solace opens a public rain cycle, drawing residents into a warm sensory ritual that naturally slows conversation. Use a special booking, maintenance interruption, or allocation discussion. Do not assume a health emergency. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Use a special booking, maintenance interruption, or allocation discussion. Do not assume a health emergency.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000002"},{"name":"Black Sky Night","eventType":"aurora_blackout","locationSlug":"eventide-overlook","participantSlugs":["dr-selene-ward","aya-nakamura","elias-thorne","priya-nwosu","theo-vance","iris-vale","noura-castillo","kenji-brooks"],"category":"environment","tone":"intimate","probability":0.45,"durationMinutes":120,"recurrence":{"weekday":6,"startMinute":1200},"summary":"The colony dims nonessential exterior lights so the aurora and night horizon become unusually vivid. Use an introductory observation outing, Aya’s consent-cleared exhibit, or a poor-visibility indoor gathering. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Use an introductory observation outing, Aya’s consent-cleared exhibit, or a poor-visibility indoor gathering.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000003"},{"name":"Low-G Night","eventType":"nightlife","locationSlug":"velvet-gravity","participantSlugs":["vesper-quinn","talia-reyes","aya-nakamura","mina-zhao","rafael-costa","micah-torres","eden-baptiste","mae-lin"],"category":"music","tone":"playful","probability":0.78,"durationMinutes":240,"recurrence":{"weekday":5,"startMinute":1260},"summary":"Velvet Gravity lowers the dance floor field for a carefully controlled night of movement, music, and interjections. Use a debut, equipment limitation, requested tribute, or collaborator-credit dispute; remember the actual performance. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Use a debut, equipment limitation, requested tribute, or collaborator-credit dispute; remember the actual performance.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000004"},{"name":"Forge Assembly","eventType":"civic_labor","locationSlug":"forge-union-hall","participantSlugs":["mateo-singh","dax-holloway","nia-calder","luc-moreau","cassian-vale","poppy-reyes","samira-cole","noah-adeyemi"],"category":"community","tone":"grounded","probability":0.58,"durationMinutes":120,"recurrence":{"weekday":3,"startMinute":1080},"summary":"A public labor and independence meeting turns practical infrastructure questions into personal disagreements. Choose one costed issue: pensions, apprentice access, or repairs. Do not repeat a generic independence speech. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Choose one costed issue: pensions, apprentice access, or repairs. Do not repeat a generic independence speech.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000005"},{"name":"The Long Table","eventType":"community_meal","locationSlug":"hearth-kitchens","participantSlugs":["sora-bell","imani-laurent","elian-park","jonah-sato","malik-orison","liora-haddad","zoe-mercer","samira-cole"],"category":"community","tone":"positive","probability":0.62,"durationMinutes":150,"recurrence":{"weekday":0,"startMinute":1020},"summary":"A communal meal invites different districts to share food, repeat traditions, and notice who sits beside whom. Use an inherited recipe, a return after an argument, a voluntary departure announcement, or an intentionally open seat. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Use an inherited recipe, a return after an argument, a voluntary departure announcement, or an intentionally open seat.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000006"},{"name":"Red Storm Lockdown","eventType":"weather_lockdown","locationSlug":"meridian-concourse","participantSlugs":["mara-venn","dr-lena-okafor","cassian-vale","talia-reyes","amaya-flores","celeste-ren","milo-jensen"],"category":"weather","tone":"tense","probability":0.18,"durationMinutes":180,"recurrence":{"random":true,"dayparts":["afternoon","evening"]},"summary":"An electrical dust storm closes exterior transit and forces plans, shifts, and conversations into shared shelter. Let boredom, shared food, redirected plans, or a missed appointment matter without adding another life-threatening crisis. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Let boredom, shared food, redirected plans, or a missed appointment matter without adding another life-threatening crisis.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000007"},{"name":"Signal Window","eventType":"signal_peak","locationSlug":"listening-station-seven","participantSlugs":["dr-selene-ward","priya-nwosu","theo-vance","aya-nakamura","iris-vale","noura-castillo","kenji-brooks"],"category":"mystery","tone":"tense","probability":0.16,"durationMinutes":75,"recurrence":{"random":true,"dayparts":["late_night"]},"summary":"The buried transmission strengthens briefly, affecting instruments and drawing prepared researchers toward Nightglass. Use sparingly to advance one observation or eliminate an interpretation; stronger transmission alone is not a new revelation. Choose a variation relevant to this session; do not assert every example occurred or repeat a resolved event.","variation":"Use sparingly to advance one observation or eliminate an interpretation; stronger transmission alone is not a new revelation.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000008"},{"name":"The Rain Is Cancelled","eventType":"solace_service_interruption","locationSlug":"rain-room","participantSlugs":["imani-laurent","elian-park","hana-petrov","zoe-mercer","naomi-varga","sora-bell","vesper-quinn","mae-lin"],"category":"community","tone":"grounded","probability":0.08,"durationMinutes":90,"recurrence":{"random":true,"dayparts":["afternoon"]},"summary":"One validated water-quality irregularity temporarily cancels a scheduled Rain Room cycle in this player’s story. This is not a permanent closure or a finding that all water is unsafe. Imani needs a preserved sample; Elian a service plan; Hana a checked measurement; Zoe accurate public wording; Naomi must avoid overconfidence. Sora can choose an alternative farewell gathering with Vesper and Mae at Static Garden during its opening hours. Offer scientific, civic, social or friendship participation without compulsory romance. Restore the cycle only after a verified correction established in this session; retain only the decisions and disclosures actually witnessed. Do not claim anyone attended a relocated gathering until they do.","id":"3b000000-0000-4000-8012-000000000009"}],"facts":[{"slug":"eos-first-fruit","title":"First Fruit","category":"culture","fact":"Orchard Nine’s first harvest may be shared with people who kept a household functioning. Gratitude, reconciliation and affection depend on the relationship, not a universal romantic meaning.","triggerTerms":["orchard","harvest","gift"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"},{"slug":"eos-leave-behind-shelf","title":"The Leave-Behind Shelf","category":"culture","fact":"Departing residents may leave one useful object at Salvage Court with an optional note. Donations are voluntary; disputed family ownership is settled before transfer.","triggerTerms":["departure","salvage","object"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"},{"slug":"eos-two-suppers","title":"Two Suppers","category":"culture","fact":"Friends on incompatible shifts sometimes eat together at the overlap: breakfast for one, dinner for the other. The custom is friendly as well as romantic.","triggerTerms":["meal","shift","breakfast"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"},{"slug":"eos-open-table","title":"The Open Table","category":"culture","fact":"The Long Table keeps a few seats unreserved. Regulars disagree about priority for isolated residents, late arrivals and visiting crews.","triggerTerms":["table","meal","seat"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"},{"slug":"eos-landing-observance","title":"Landing Observance","category":"culture","fact":"The official ceremony celebrates endurance. Some residents separately remember the missing hours; others reject making an unanswered question a ritual. Neither practice is universal.","triggerTerms":["landing","ceremony","memorial"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"},{"slug":"eos-heritage-and-home","title":"Heritage and Home","category":"culture","fact":"Earth-derived heritage labels describe author-facing ancestry and inherited family culture, not personal familiarity with modern Earth countries. Home means belonging, not necessarily birthplace. Do not invent a named off-world birthplace when it is unspecified.","triggerTerms":["heritage","birthplace","home"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"},{"slug":"eos-lyra-renewal","title":"The Year 20 Renewal","category":"culture","fact":"The Lyra emergency and associated renewal of the founding agreement occurred in Year 20, eighteen years before the present. Naomi was 28, Malik 21, Luc 33, Jonah 24 and Rhea 22. They were not adult decision-makers at first landing. The seventeen missing hours belong to Year 0. They remain separate from Year 20 unless evidence in a player’s story establishes a limited connection.","triggerTerms":["lyra","renewal","founding","age"],"truthMode":"canonical","knowledgeScope":"public","contentLevel":"standard"}],"schedules":[{"ch